## Conversation
User asked to consolidate a messy working tree. During review I found the
worktree copy of claude_settings.json had silently lost its `hooks` block
(the rtk PreToolUse hook) and `extraKnownMarketplaces`. I flagged both as
likely-unintentional app rewrites and restored them. The user then said
they actually wanted both gone, and separately asked to remove the rtk
import and binary. So this commit reverses my restoration on purpose.

## Actions
- Removed the `hooks` key entirely from claude_settings.json (not set to
  `{}` -- the key is deleted).
- Removed the `@RTK.md` line from CLAUDE_global.md.
- Ran `cargo uninstall rtk`, which reported removing
  /Users/abatilo/.cargo/bin/rtk. Verified `rtk` is off PATH and absent
